          "email": "green@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-08-24 03:04:14.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-930 doc: fix broken man page redirects",
        "message": "LU-930 doc: fix broken man page redirects\n\nllapi_changelog_fini.3, llapi_changelog_free.3 and\nllapi_changelog_set_xflags.3 redirected into man1/, where no such page\nexists, and lctl-llog-{cancel,catlist,info}.8 redirected to\nthemselves, which makes groff recurse until it is killed.  Point all\nsix at the pages they mean.  The four lctl-llog-*.8 stubs were also\nnever installed, so list them beside the underscore spellings the way\nthe nodemap and lfsck aliases already are.\n\nFixes: 3fe6dac42bba (\"LU-12837 doc: add llapi_changelog* manpages\")\nFixes: fe4b49635d85 (\"LU-18114 llog: split \"lctl llog_*\" group into subcommands\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: Icf7d9e46c05d543e842331ca5e500858e6e43cd1\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
